00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:30.300
What type of enemies are in here?

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:33.400
In this game, you wouldn't do that for the individual stages.

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:35.140
You don't need to make those kinds of maps.

