00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:10.700
I guess it could be like a way of like, you know, you're progressing because you're now learning.

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:12.380
You're filling, you're learning which is which.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:21.200
Well, numbers and also like things like, oh, there's a there's X key item here, and now I got to get there.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:24.160
But I agree that it is it.

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:28.180
It's a it's a very small amount of information to leave out.

