00:21:54.920 --> 00:22:01.460
What's this guy do? You know, like they were never like, you know, they're not in my contention of like best designed boss fights ever.

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:10.380
But they they're I'd say that they were definitely better than than maybe the majority of what we see at the NES when it comes to trying to a boss battle.

00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:19.300
I think it's because it's there's they're not they're they're not easy fights, but they're easy to learn how they how they fight.

